Derived works and acknowledgments
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

ThingsFlow includes selected material derived from or interoperating with
ThingsBoard Community Edition (https://github.com/thingsboard/thingsboard),
which is also licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

    Copyright © 2016 The ThingsBoard Authors

The portions of this codebase that are direct derivations of, or that
interoperate with, the ThingsBoard schema and API contracts include:

  - The PostgreSQL schema (table names, column shapes, ID conventions,
    rule-chain canvas JSON) consumed by the ThingsBoard web UI.
  - Selected JSON resources under flow-core/tb-resources/ (system widget
    bundles, dashboards, OAuth2 templates, SCADA symbols) that ship as
    bootstrap content for compatibility with the upstream UI.
  - The HTTP / WebSocket REST contract that the ThingsBoard web UI
    expects (e.g. /api/auth/login, /api/tenant/devices,
    /api/dashboard/{id}/metaData).

The ThingsFlow runtime code under flow-core/, the Helm chart under
k8s/helm/thingsflow/, the docker-compose stack under docker/, and the
operational runbooks under docs/ were authored independently for this project.

The "ThingsBoard" name and logo are trademarks of ThingsBoard, Inc. and
are not used as part of ThingsFlow identity. References in code or
documentation to "TB" or "ThingsBoard" describe API/schema shape only.

